Betaflight Configurator for EmberBSD.

Desktop UI for the Betaflight flight-controller firmware
(https://github.com/betaflight/betaflight). Upstream ships a Tauri app;
this port packages the Vite web UI with the system Electron runtime and
Web Serial so it runs on EmberBSD Plasma.

Built from betaflight-configurator 2026.6.2. Native Tauri/serialplugin
is not used; USB links use Chromium Web Serial.
